  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n△ × 2.2 + 0.33 × (3 ÷ 4) − (1 ÷ 20) × 0.55 = 0.99\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\nBODMAS rule\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ 0.33 × (3 ÷ 4) = 0.33 × 0.75 = 0.2475\n\n⇒ (1 ÷ 20) × 0.55 = 0.05 × 0.55 = 0.0275\n\n⇒ △ × 2.2 + 0.2475 − 0.0275 = 0.99\n\n⇒ △ × 2.2 + 0.22 = 0.99\n\n⇒ △ × 2.2 = 0.99 − 0.22\n\n⇒ △ × 2.2 = 0.77\n\n⇒ △ = 0.77 ÷ 2.2\n\n⇒ △ = 0.35\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 0.35.**",
